@startuml deployment_view_phase3
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "Clients\n(Web/Mobile)" as Client
node "KrakenD\nAPI Gateway" as Gateway

node "Microservices (Go)" {
  component "Identity & Auth\nService" as Identity
  component "Accounts\nService" as Accounts
  component "Transactions\nService" as Transactions
}

database "Identity DB" as DB_Id
database "Accounts DB" as DB_Acc
database "Transactions DB" as DB_Tx
database "Redis" as Redis

node "Observability Stack" {
  component "Prometheus" as Prom
  component "Grafana" as Grafana
}

Client --> Gateway : HTTPS
Gateway --> Identity : REST / Internal Route
Gateway --> Accounts : REST / Internal Route
Gateway --> Transactions : REST / Internal Route

Identity --> DB_Id
Accounts --> DB_Acc
Transactions --> DB_Tx

Accounts .> Redis : Caching
Transactions .> Redis : Caching

Transactions --> Accounts : POST /internal/v1/accounts/transfer
Accounts --> Transactions : GET /internal/v1/ledger/:id

Identity -.-> Prom
Accounts -.-> Prom
Transactions -.-> Prom
Gateway -.-> Prom
Grafana --> Prom
@enduml
